<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1498_5393.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser früntlich willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, unnd was wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eeren</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegens</unclear>, zuvor Fromm,
<lb n="3"/>Fürsichtig, Ersam wyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ynnsonnders</unclear> guot Fründ
<lb n="4"/>unnd gethrüw lieb Eydtgnossen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnß</unclear> hat
<lb n="5"/>unnsers burgers, <persName resp="#ner">Niclauß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Seeholtzers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">saeligen</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinndergelaßne</unclear> tochter, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">namen</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Barbara <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">See</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">holtzerin</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichttet</unclear>. Wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">das</unclear> sy sich vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">veruckter</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>zyt, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgeren</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">N: <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zollihofferen</unclear></persName>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verelichett</unclear>, unnd bedacht syge, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eelicher</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>pflicht nach, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ynn</unclear> syn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vatterlannd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeziehen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßwegen</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> nit nun umb ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zügknuß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yrer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhalt</unclear>-
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nuß</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">harkommens</unclear>. Sonnder auch umb ein
<lb n="13"/>fürschrifft an üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepätten</unclear>, sy unnd gedachten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yren</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eeman</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßnn</unclear>, daß sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Seeholtzerin</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zytlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haab</unclear> unnd guot, alß aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwere</unclear>,
<lb n="16"/>derglychen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frömbden</unclear> wybs personen wegen,
<lb n="17"/>habende ordnung zuogibt, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versechen</unclear> sye moechte,
<lb n="18"/>nützit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entgelten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zelaßen</unclear>, sonnders sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">midt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desto</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weniger</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ynn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear> burgerlichen schirm <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zebehalten</unclear>,
<lb n="20"/>da sy der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoffnung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßelben</unclear> by üch nit wenig
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zegeniessen</unclear>. Wann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nu</unclear> ein Jede
<lb n="22"/>Oberkeit die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">yrigen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zebefürderen</unclear> schuldig, wie
<lb n="23"/>auch daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuond</unclear>, sonnderlich geneigt. So yst
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruf</unclear> unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlichs</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnosßisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yr</unclear> wollind gegen obgedachtem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>burger, Im <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fhall</unclear> er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ordnungen</unclear> unnd
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Satzungen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuowider</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehanndlet</unclear> hette, nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">strenge</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>thun, unnd üch demselben, sampt bemelter
<lb n="29"/>syner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eefrouwen</unclear>, von diser unnser fürschrifft
<lb n="30"/>wegen, unnd auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ynnansechen</unclear>, daß sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Seeholtzeri</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> Eerlichen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lüthen</unclear>, ouch mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotem</unclear> namen
<lb n="32"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lümbden</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annderß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bewußt</unclear>)
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgescheiden</unclear>, Inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guotem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gunst</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eeren</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1498_5394.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müglicheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolchen</unclear> syn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>. Das begeren wir umb
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jederzyt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verdienen</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuond</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> samptlich Goettlichem schirm bevelchen.
<lb n="37"/>Dat. <origDate when="1606-02-24" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Monntags</unclear> den 24 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Februarij</unclear> Anno 1606</origDate>.
<lb n="38"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rate</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>der Statt Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1498_5395.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1498_5396.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Denen</unclear> frommen, fürsichtigen,
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersamen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿsen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister
<lb n="42"/>unnd Rhat der statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sannct</unclear>
<lb n="43"/>Gallen</orgName>, unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>fründen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eÿdtgnoßen</unclear>.
</p>
